    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d639">

                <pb facs="0764" n="644" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg644"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Ambassador
                        Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-03-28"><hi rendition="#italic">March 28,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1262.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    dispatch, No. 2708, of the 16th instant, acknowledging the Department’s telegram
                    of the 14th instant. * * *</p>
                <p>Your representations to the Mexican Government regarding the effectiveness of
                    Mexican precautions against the Yaquis and your course in the matter are
                    approved by the Department. You will press for due protection for American
                    citizens in Sonora.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
